---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Insights
titleTag: "Insights on founder dependency and company design | Orbsi"
ogTitle: "Insights on founder dependency and company design"
description: "Writing on how founder-led companies get built, why work keeps coming back to one person, and what changes when the structure and the leaders change together."
permalink: /insights/index.html
image: /img/og/og-home.png
---
<style>
  .ins-list{margin-top:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,3.5rem)}
  .ins-item{display:block;padding:clamp(1.7rem,3.2vw,2.4rem) 0;border-top:1px solid var(--pale)}
  .ins-item:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--pale)}
  .ins-item time{font-size:.6875rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;
    text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--violet)}
  .ins-item h2{margin-top:.75rem;font-size:clamp(1.45rem,2.9vw,2.3rem);font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:-.032em;line-height:1.12;max-width:24ch;color:var(--ink);transition:color .25s}
  .ins-item p{margin-top:.85rem;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.72;color:var(--ink-2);max-width:58ch}
  .ins-item .go{margin-top:1.15rem;display:inline-block;font-size:.6875rem;font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--violet);
    border-bottom:2px solid var(--violet);padding-bottom:.3rem}
  .ins-item:hover h2{color:var(--violet)}
  .ins-empty{margin-top:2.5rem;color:var(--slate)}
</style>

<header id="main" class="band--paper" style="padding:clamp(3rem,6vw,5.5rem) 0 clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem);position:relative;overflow:hidden">
  <span class="ring-mark" style="width:min(48vw,620px);aspect-ratio:1;border:clamp(28px,4vw,58px) solid var(--sky-band);right:-14%;top:-22%;opacity:.75"></span>
  <div class="wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1">
    <span class="eyebrow">Insights</span>
    <h1 class="hero-head rv" style="max-width:19ch">Writing on <span class="acc"><span style="white-space:nowrap">founder-led</span> companies</span>.</h1>
    <div class="hero-row hero-row--solo">
      <div class="rv">
        <p class="lede" style="font-size:clamp(1.1rem,1.75vw,1.42rem);max-width:52ch">How companies get
          built, why <span class="hl">founder dependency</span> happens, and what becomes possible when
          the company, the leaders, and the founder change together.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="ticker ticker--sky" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="tk">
    <span class="lbl">Insights</span><span class="ring"></span>
    <span class="lbl">Insights</span><span class="ring"></span>
    <span class="lbl">Insights</span><span class="ring"></span>
    <span class="lbl">Insights</span><span class="ring"></span>
    <span class="lbl">Insights</span><span class="ring"></span>
    <span class="lbl">Insights</span><span class="ring"></span>
    <span class="lbl">Insights</span><span class="ring"></span>
    <span class="lbl">Insights</span><span class="ring"></span>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="band band--white">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if collections.insights.length %}
    <div class="ins-list">
      {%- for post in collections.insights %}
      <a class="ins-item rv" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.summary or post.data.description }}</p>
        <span class="go">Read this</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p class="ins-empty">No articles yet.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--ink">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</span>
    <h2 class="h-sec rv" style="max-width:18ch">Let's Redesign Your Company <span class="acc">Together</span>.</h2>
    <div class="btn-row rv" style="margin-top:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.75rem)">
      <a href="https://scheduler.zoom.us/orbsi/discovery-call" class="btn btn--sun">Book a Conversation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
